msgstr "Stüert dat Överboken vun Ressourcen bi't Planen"

#. +> trunk
#: models/kptcommonstrings.cpp:128
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<para>Controls resource overbooking when scheduling.</para>"
"<para>If overbooking is allowed, a resource may be booked (on working days) to work more than it is available. This can happen if the resource is allocated to multiple tasks or are booked on other projects.</para>"
"<para>If overbooking is to be avoided, resources will not be booked more than they are available. On resource conflict, tasks will be delayed until the resource is available.</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Stüert dat Överboken vun Ressourcen bi't Planen.</para>"
"<para>Is »Överboken« tolaten, lett sik en Ressource (an Warkdaag) för mehr Opgaven boken, as se verföögbor is. Dat kann vörkamen, wenn de Ressource mehr Opgaven towiest sünd, oder wenn se för anner Projekten inplaant is.</para>"
"<para>Is keen »Överboken« tolaten, laat sik Ressourcen nich fakener boken, as se verföögbor sünd. Bi Ressourcenkonflikten warrt töövt, bet de Ressource wedder verföögbor is.</para>"

#. +> trunk stable
#: models/kptcommonstrings.cpp:134
msgid "The distribution to be used during scheduling"
msgstr "De verdelen, de wielt dat Planen bruukt warrt"

#. +> trunk
#: models/kptcommonstrings.cpp:136
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<para>The distribution to be used during scheduling</para>"
"<para>If distribution is 'None', the tasks estimate is used as is during scheduling.</para>"
"<para>If distribution is 'PERT', the estimate used is calculated based on the entered optimistic- (O), pessimistic-(P) and most likely (M) estimate. The formula used for this is (O + 4 * M + P) / 6."
"<para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>De Verdelen, de bi't Planen bruukt warrt</para>"
"<para>Is as Verdelen »Keen« angeven, warrt de Estemeren för de Opgaav bi't Planen ahn Ännern bruukt.</para>"
"<para>Is de »PERT-Verdelen« angeven, warrt de bruukt Estemeren utreekt, de op de ingeven toversichtlich- (O), nich toversichtlich-(P) un wohrschienlich (M)  Estemeren opbuut. Dor warrt disse Formel för bruukt: (O + 4 * M + P) / 6."
"<para>"

#. +> trunk stable
#: models/kptcommonstrings.cpp:142
msgid "Defines the schedules to be calculated"
msgstr "Leggt de Plaans fast, de utreekt warrn mööt"

#. +> trunk stable
#: models/kptcommonstrings.cpp:143
msgid "The scheduled start time"
msgstr "De plaante Starttiet"

#. +> trunk stable
#: models/kptcommonstrings.cpp:144
msgid "The scheduled finish time"
msgstr "De plaante Enntiet"

#. +> trunk stable
#: models/kptcommonstrings.cpp:145
msgid "The scheduling direction"
msgstr "De plaante Richt"

#. +> trunk
#: models/kptcommonstrings.cpp:147
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<para>The scheduling direction.</para>"
"<para>If direction is Forward, the project is scheduled starting at the projects earliest start time specified in the main project dialog.</para>"
"<para>If direction is Backward, the project is scheduled starting at the projects latest finish time specified in the main project dialog.</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>De plaante Richt.</para>"
"<para>Is de Richt »Vörut«, warrt de Projektstart to de fröhste Starttiet plaant, de in den Hööft-Projektdialoog angeven is.</para>"
"<para>Is de Richt »Achterut«, richt sik de Projektstartplanen na de laatste Enntiet, de in den Hööft-Projektdialoog angeven is.</para>"

#. +> trunk stable
#: models/kptcommonstrings.cpp:153
msgid "The scheduler used for calculating the project schedule"
msgstr "De Planer, mit den de Projektplaan utreekt warrt"

#. +> trunk
#: models/kptcommonstrings.cpp:155
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<para>The scheduler used for calculating the project schedule.</para>"
"<para>The default built-in scheduler is the Network Scheduler.</para>"
"<para>Other schedulers presently available is RCPS if libRCPS is installed on your system. RCPS is a genetics based resource constrained project scheduler.</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>De Planer, mit den de Projektplaan utreekt warrt.</para>"
"<para>De inbuut Standardplaner is de Nettwarkplaner.</para>"
"<para>En anner verföögbor Planer is RCPS, wenn libRCPS op Dien Reekner installeert is. RCPS is en ressourcenafhangen Projektplaner, de op Genetik opbuut.</para>"

